    "audio": "audio/quake_mountain_valley/R-1.ogg",
    "script": "Base, this is Mountain Rescue Unit Two at kilometre fourteen on the pass road. Landslide covered the road, at least one car buried, we can hear a horn. We lose radio contact beyond the bend, we need a relay. Over."
