    "session": "call",
    "cell": "V1",
    "audio": "audio/quake_mountain_valley/C-4.ogg",
    "script": "My father fell from the ladder when it started. His leg is bent the wrong way and he is bleeding a lot. We are on the main road next to the bakery, please send an ambulance.",
